  "publicId": "c20430eb-7e7e-44e6-b769-3c7756e6a9e2",
  "name": "XCrypt | Blockchain Wallet",
  "alias": null,
  "accountGrade": 4.4,
  "description": "XCrypt | Blockchain Wallet is a HIPAA compliant, AI assisted revenue and follow up operating system for orthodontists and general dentists performing high-ticket treatments. This Statement of Work covers the MVP Phase 1 build and the subsequent growth phases.\n\nObjectives: negotiate treatment pricing and payment plans deterministically through AI assisted conversations; improve case acceptance rates by 10-15% through realtime treatment coordinator coaching; collect down payments and recurring payments securely; track and recover deferred cases through structured observation workflows; maintain full auditability and financial governance while keeping decision authority with the practice.\n\nKey deliverables: three layer financial firewall architecture (conversational layer, deterministic constraint engine, ledger layer); patient negotiation portal with AI assisted coaching; treatment coordinator chairside tablet application; payment processing integration with PHI shield architecture; observation recall and follow-up system; HIPAA compliant infrastructure and audit logging; web based staff dashboards for operations and financial visibility.",
